cond game mode will be available in the demo, right in time for Steam Next Fest!The alchemist has marked every page in the encyclopedia with the category, so you can lock in on the sorting alone, and enjoy an even cozier experience. (Is that even possible?) Choose your playstyleSort the alchemy shop in a relaxed, soothing pace in the Relaxed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:50:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687424","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079620-1846018067941568","game_id":"steam-5079620","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is out!","summary":"Hello Apprentices!We are glad to announce the demo for Potions Galore is out now! Get to reading and sorting! What will you find in the demo?Lobby area to explore and sort447 potions to discover and read aboutAZERTY support as a Gameplay option until full input remappingThe shop opens its doors only for the lobby area. The rest will be blocked off as they are not yet ready for the public. Tell your friends, and come read, sort, and learn about the world of Potions Galore!Aaaaalso we have reached","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:39:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941568","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079620-1845383656394416","game_id":"steam-5079620","kind":"announcement","title":"700 Apprentices Waiting","summary":"Dear Apprentices, Two weeks ago we were a bundle of nerves because nobody knew about us ːsteamsadː. Today, you are 700 Apprentices waiting to read about potions and sort them in their rightful place. And you are growing in number by the days! We would like to thank you for your continuous support. To celebrate, we are happy to announce the new steam artwork has arrived. How do you like the new look? The free Demo is coming on October 12th! Then a week later, you will find us in the Next Fest cra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T19:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394416","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079620-1844751498235285","game_id":"steam-5079620","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming October 12th","summary":"Hello Apprentices!We are very thankful for your presence on our social media! We cannot wait to get Potions Galore in your hands... So we are doing everything possible to release a public demo on October 12th!Wishlist now if you haven't already!More devlogs to come on our socials!Thank you,Bogdan & RalucaPlaymunch team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T19:38:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235285","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079620-1844115010498635","game_id":"steam-5079620","kind":"announcement","title":"Fantasy, Process, and AI Usage | Devlog","summary":"Hello alchemists and apprentices! We wanted to dive a bit into what motivated the creation of Potions Galore. The whole game revolves around one idea, that acted as our guiding light: “What if you actually were in an Alchemist’s house-shop, and you’d have all these potions that someone worked hard to make, and you’d be able to read about them in an exhaustive tome?”So that’s what we did. We created a tome that is populated as you pick up new potions. If the title is not explanatory enough to gui","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T09:48:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079620-1844115010495333","game_id":"steam-5079620","kind":"announcement","title":"Potions Galore Official Announcement!","summary":"Hello alchemists and apprentices! We are a very excited duo team and we finally get to reveal our first game, Potions Galore! It’s our own spin of the cozy organisation genre, born from our love of everything magical and whimsical! Watch the reveal trailer below!Key Features:Organize 2979 potion bottles in their respective shelves.Read labels and encyclopedia descriptions, then use your intuition to find the correct placement in one of our seven potion categories!Use any sorting strategy you kno","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T16:09:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5079620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5079620":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5079620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z"},"5347780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:47Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5079620","app_id":5079620,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:24Z","source_url":"https